WEBVTT

00:06:27.758 --> 00:06:31.137
which is what is continually
happening on the men's side.

00:06:31.846 --> 00:06:35.558
When I worked at ESPN
and I would do a TV show,

00:06:35.599 --> 00:06:37.101
I was in the production room,

00:06:37.143 --> 00:06:39.687
and I was always pitching
women's sports stories.

00:06:39.687 --> 00:06:41.355
It almost never worked.

00:06:42.398 --> 00:06:45.151
Every once in a while, it would work.

00:06:45.151 --> 00:06:47.570
And the thing about doing sports on TV ...

00:06:48.696 --> 00:06:52.241
is that you are not actually an expert
at everything you're talking about.

00:06:52.241 --> 00:06:53.742
(Laughter)

00:06:53.742 --> 00:06:56.078
But you read, you do your homework,

00:06:56.078 --> 00:06:58.080
you figure out a position.

00:06:59.957 --> 00:07:03.586
But this thing would happen
when we would do a women's sports segment: